---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'September 7, 2026';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="How TechOnPlay (techonplay.com) collects, uses, and protects your information.">
  <section class="container legal-page">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        This Privacy Policy explains how TechOnPlay, accessible from
        techonplay.com ("we," "us," or "our"), collects, uses,
        and protects information when you visit this site.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you have additional questions or require more information about
        this Privacy Policy, do not hesitate to <a href="/contact">contact us</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Log Files</h2>
      <p>
        TechOnPlay follows a standard procedure of using log files. These files
        log visitors when they visit websites. All hosting companies do this
        as part of their hosting services' analytics. The information
        collected by log files includes IP addresses, browser type, Internet
        Service Provider (ISP), date and time stamp, referring/exit pages,
        and possibly the number of clicks. This information is not linked to
        anything that is personally identifiable, and is used for analyzing
        trends, administering the site, and gathering demographic information.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies and Web Beacons</h2>
      <p>
        Like most websites, TechOnPlay uses cookies to store information about
        visitors' preferences and the pages a visitor accessed. This
        information is used to optimize visitors' experience by customizing
        page content based on browser type and other information. See our
        {' '}<a href="/cookie-policy">Cookie Policy</a> for full details on the
        types of cookies we use.
      </p>

      <h2>Google Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        We use Google Analytics to understand how visitors interact with our
        content — which pages are popular, how long visitors stay, and where
        traffic comes from. This data is aggregated and does not identify you
        individually.
      </p>

      <h2>Google AdSense &amp; Advertising Partners</h2>
      <p>
        We use Google AdSense to serve advertisements on this site. Google,
        as a third-party vendor, uses cookies to serve ads based on a user's
        prior visits to this and other websites. Google's use of advertising
        cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads based on your visit
        to TechOnPlay and/or other sites on the internet.
      </p>
      <p>
        You may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting
        {' '}<a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google's Ad Settings</a>,
        or opt out of a third-party vendor's use of cookies for interest-based
        advertising by visiting {' '}<a href="https://www.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">aboutads.info</a>.
        We have no access to or control over the cookies used by third-party
        advertisers.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-party services</h2>
      <p>
        We rely on third-party services to operate this site, including a
        hosting provider and an email delivery provider for the newsletter.
        Each of these providers processes data under its own privacy policy.
      </p>

      <h2>CCPA Privacy Rights (Do Not Sell My Personal Information)</h2>
      <p>
        Under the CCPA, among other rights, California consumers have the
        right to request that a business disclose the categories and
        specific pieces of personal data it has collected, request deletion
        of that data, and opt out of the sale of that data. If you make a
        request, we have one month to respond. To exercise any of these
        rights, please <a href="/contact">contact us</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>GDPR Data Protection Rights</h2>
      <p>Every user is entitled to the following, subject to applicable conditions:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>The right to access — request copies of your personal data.</li>
        <li>The right to rectification — request correction of inaccurate or incomplete data.</li>
        <li>The right to erasure — request that we erase your personal data.</li>
        <li>The right to restrict processing — request that we restrict how we use your data.</li>
        <li>The right to object to processing — object to our processing of your data.</li>
        <li>The right to data portability — request that we transfer your data to another organization, or to you.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Children's Information</h2>
      <p>
        TechOnPlay does not knowingly collect any personally identifiable
        information from children under the age of 13. If you believe your
        child provided this kind of information on our site, please
        {' '}<a href="/contact">contact us</a> immediately and we will
        promptly remove such information from our records.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this policy from time to time. We'll update the "Last
        updated" date above when we do.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact us</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this policy? Reach out through our
        {' '}<a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    padding-block: 56px 80px;
    max-width: 68ch;
  }

  .updated {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin: 12px 0 32px;
  }
</style>
